# 统一行尾为 LF，避免 Windows 上 CRLF 造成整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做行尾转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.tga  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.wav  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# 仓库内的 Markdown 按文本处理，便于 GitHub 渲染
*.md text
